                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This database presents pantomimes used to depict 60 objects from the Boston Naming Test. These are depicted by 20 non-brain-damaged participants and 38 people with aphasia. The latter group depicted a subset of 30 items. The database shows the representation techniques individuals used to depict these items and their comprehensibility. "
                },
